      "help_zh": "表的唯一标识，格式为odps.projectName.tableName。您可以通过调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2780086.html，获取表的唯一标识。\n当前仅支持调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2780094.html获取MaxCompute表的变更日志",
